<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inconsiderate,
				unreflecting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄσκεπτα λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					14.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				438a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.45d
			</span></i>: mostly in Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>inadvisedly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				158e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					440d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					501c
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1274a30
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unconsidered, unobserved,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.2.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ τὸ μέγιστον ἐπιστήμης πέρι τί ποτ᾽
					ἐστὶν ἄσκεπτον γένηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					184a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unseen, hidden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.773
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>too small to be observed, negligible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀσκέπτῳ χρόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					0.89b10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
